er"/></g></svg></span><div class="wprm-recipe-rating-details wprm-block-text-none"><span class="wprm-recipe-rating-average">5</span> from <span class="wprm-recipe-rating-count">14</span> votes</div></div></div><p class="post-date"> Apr 07, 2021</p><p class="post-comments"><a href="#comments">38 Comments</a></p></div></div></div></div><div class="site-inner" id="main-content"><div class="content-area"><main class="site-main" role="main"><article class="type-post"><div class="entry-content"><div class="post-intro"><div class="wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex"><a class="wp-element-button" href="#wprm-recipe-container-34889">Jump to Recipe</a><a class="wp-element-button" href="#respond">Rate Recipe</a></div><div class="aff-disc"><p>This post contains affiliate links. Please see our <a href="https://www.veganricha.com/privacy-policy/">disclosure policy</a>.</p>
</div></div><p>This Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake is a rich and moist chocolate cake baked in a loaf pan, with the traditional nutty pecan and coconut caramel filling running through the middle!<br />
<img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/?tp_image_id=34871" data-pin-title="Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake" class="alignnone wp-image-34871 size-full" title="German Chocolate Loaf Cake" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201200%201800'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="Vegan German chocolate loaf cake with one slice cut" width="1200" height="1800" data-pin-description="This Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake is a rich and moist chocolate cake baked in a loaf pan, with the traditional nutty pecan and coconut caramel filling running through the middle!" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/" data-jpibfi-post-title="German Chocolate Loaf Cake" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4947.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4947.jpg 1200w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4947-400x600.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4947-683x1024.jpg 683w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4947-302x453.jpg 302w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4947-768x1152.jpg 768w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4947-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4947-450x676.jpg 450w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" data-lazy-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4947.jpg" /><noscript><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/?tp_image_id=34871" data-pin-title="Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake" class="alignnone wp-image-34871 size-full" title="German Chocolate Loaf Cake" src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4947.jpg" alt="Vegan German chocolate loaf cake with one slice cut" width="1200" height="1800" data-pin-description="This Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake is a rich and moist chocolate cake baked in a loaf pan, with the traditional nutty pecan and coconut caramel filling running through the middle!" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/" data-jpibfi-post-title="German Chocolate Loaf Cake" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4947.jpg" srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4947.jpg 1200w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4947-400x600.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4947-683x1024.jpg 683w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4947-302x453.jpg 302w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4947-768x1152.jpg 768w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4947-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4947-450x676.jpg 450w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></noscript></p>
<p>Anytime coconut is involved, any dessert has the potential to turn into one of my favorites!  I LOVE me a slice of classic German Chocolate Cake!  However, I hardly ever get around to making intricate layer cakes! This loaf cake version comes to the rescue! It is easier to put together—no layer cakes to fuss over—and it doesn’t lack one bit in the flavor department. Rich and chocolatey with the classic nutty caramel pecan filling, this easy vegan loaf cake is really hard to resist. I think you’ll love it!</p>
<p><img decoding="async" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/?tp_image_id=34857" data-pin-title="Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake" class="alignnone wp-image-34857 size-full" title="Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201200%201800'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake with a coconut caramel swirl in the middle" width="1200" height="1800" data-pin-description="This Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake is a rich and moist chocolate cake baked in a loaf pan, with the traditional nutty pecan and coconut caramel filling running through the middle!" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/" data-jpibfi-post-title="German Chocolate Loaf Cake" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4956.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4956.jpg 1200w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4956-400x600.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4956-683x1024.jpg 683w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4956-302x453.jpg 302w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4956-768x1152.jpg 768w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4956-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4956-450x676.jpg 450w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" data-lazy-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4956.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/?tp_image_id=34857" data-pin-title="Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake" class="alignnone wp-image-34857 size-full" title="Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake" src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4956.jpg" alt="vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake with a coconut caramel swirl in the middle" width="1200" height="1800" data-pin-description="This Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake is a rich and moist chocolate cake baked in a loaf pan, with the traditional nutty pecan and coconut caramel filling running through the middle!" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/" data-jpibfi-post-title="German Chocolate Loaf Cake" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4956.jpg" srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4956.jpg 1200w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4956-400x600.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4956-683x1024.jpg 683w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4956-302x453.jpg 302w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4956-768x1152.jpg 768w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4956-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4956-450x676.jpg 450w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></noscript></p>
<p>Hmmm &#8211; what&#8217;s not to love about a slice of rich and dense vegan chocolate loaf cake that perfectly sandwiches a caramel-y layer of coconut and pecans? Add a generous drizzle of dark chocolate and we&#8217;re in dessert heaven!</p>
<p>If you love all things German Chocolate make sure to check out my <a href="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-cookies/">German Chocolate Cookies!</a></p>
