<h2>Ingredients:</h2>
<ul>
<li>flour &#8211; I use all-purpose mixed with cornstarch for a more tender crumb</li>
<li>cocoa powder &#8211; Dutch processed works best</li>
<li>a shot of espresso enhances the chocolate flavor. You can use 1 tsp instant coffee mixed in two tbsp of hot water instead</li>
<li>a mix of baking powder and baking soda is responsible for the rise</li>
<li>vinegar makes the <b>cake</b> batter more acidic. This results in a loaf cake that is fluffy yet still moist.</li>
<li>a combination of vegan yogurt or apple sauce and oil is added for moisture</li>
<li>You can use any non-dairy milk as the liquid for this cake batter</li>
<li>I sweeten the cake with regular sugar &#8211; you can use up to 2 tbsp more for a sweeter loaf</li>
<li>vanilla &#8211; always</li>
<li>what turns this chocolate loaf into a German chocolate loaf cake is the caramel &amp; pecan coconut swirl in the middle. It&#8217;s a simple mix of blended dates, maple syrup and toasted, ground pecans, and coconut.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Tips &amp; Substitutions:</h2>
<ul>
<li>if you&#8217;re allergic to pecans, use walnuts</li>
<li>mix your batter until smooth, but no longer</li>
<li>don&#8217;t skip toasting the nuts &#8211; it makes a huge difference in flavor</li>
<li>you could turn this loaf cake into a German chocolate muffin recipe. I recommend baking them for about 24 minutes. Check them for doneness with a toothpick</li>
</ul>
<p><img decoding="async" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/?tp_image_id=34862" data-pin-title="Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake" class="alignnone wp-image-34862" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201200%20800'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="ingredients needed for making vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cakes" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-description="This Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake is a rich and moist chocolate cake baked in a loaf pan, with the traditional nutty pecan and coconut caramel filling running through the middle!" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/" data-jpibfi-post-title="German Chocolate Loaf Cake" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4921-e1617743029295.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4921-e1617743029295.jpg 1800w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4921-e1617743029295-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4921-e1617743029295-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4921-e1617743029295-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4921-e1617743029295-768x512.jpg 768w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" data-lazy-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4921-e1617743029295.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/?tp_image_id=34862" data-pin-title="Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake" class="alignnone wp-image-34862" src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4921-e1617743029295.jpg" alt="ingredients needed for making vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cakes" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-description="This Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake is a rich and moist chocolate cake baked in a loaf pan, with the traditional nutty pecan and coconut caramel filling running through the middle!" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/" data-jpibfi-post-title="German Chocolate Loaf Cake" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4921-e1617743029295.jpg" srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4921-e1617743029295.jpg 1800w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4921-e1617743029295-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4921-e1617743029295-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4921-e1617743029295-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4921-e1617743029295-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></noscript></p>
<h2>How to Make Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake</h2>
<p><img decoding="async" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/?tp_image_id=34865" data-pin-title="Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake" class="alignnone wp-image-34865" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201200%20800'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="ingredients needed for making caramel coconut swirl for German chocolate loaf cake" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-description="This Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake is a rich and moist chocolate cake baked in a loaf pan, with the traditional nutty pecan and coconut caramel filling running through the middle!" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/" data-jpibfi-post-title="German Chocolate Loaf Cake" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4927-e1617742269598.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4927-e1617742269598.jpg 1800w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4927-e1617742269598-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4927-e1617742269598-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4927-e1617742269598-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4927-e1617742269598-768x512.jpg 768w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" data-lazy-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4927-e1617742269598.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/?tp_image_id=34865" data-pin-title="Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake" class="alignnone wp-image-34865" src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4927-e1617742269598.jpg" alt="ingredients needed for making caramel coconut swirl for German chocolate loaf cake" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-description="This Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake is a rich and moist chocolate cake baked in a loaf pan, with the traditional nutty pecan and coconut caramel filling running through the middle!" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/" data-jpibfi-post-title="German Chocolate Loaf Cake" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4927-e1617742269598.jpg" srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4927-e1617742269598.jpg 1800w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4927-e1617742269598-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4927-e1617742269598-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4927-e1617742269598-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4927-e1617742269598-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></noscript></p>
<p>Soak the dates in hot water for at least 15 minutes, then drain. Blend the soaked dates with the milk, and maple syrup until well blended.</p>
<p><img decoding="async" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/?tp_image_id=34866" data-pin-title="Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake" class="alignnone wp-image-34866" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201200%20800'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="date caramel being mixed with shredded coconut and pecans for German chocolate cake recipe" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-description="This Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake is a rich and moist chocolate cake baked in a loaf pan, with the traditional nutty pecan and coconut caramel filling running through the middle!" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/" data-jpibfi-post-title="German Chocolate Loaf Cake" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4929-e1617742338934.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4929-e1617742338934.jpg 1800w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4929-e1617742338934-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4929-e1617742338934-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4929-e1617742338934-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4929-e1617742338934-768x512.jpg 768w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" data-lazy-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4929-e1617742338934.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/?tp_image_id=34866" data-pin-title="Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake" class="alignnone wp-image-34866" src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4929-e1617742338934.jpg" alt="date caramel being mixed with shredded coconut and pecans for German chocolate cake recipe" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-description="This Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake is a rich and moist chocolate cake baked in a loaf pan, with the traditional nutty pecan and coconut caramel filling running through the middle!" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/" data-jpibfi-post-title="German Chocolate Loaf Cake" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4929-e1617742338934.jpg" srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4929-e1617742338934.jpg 1800w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4929-e1617742338934-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4929-e1617742338934-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4929-e1617742338934-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4929-e1617742338934-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></noscript></p>
<p>If you haven&#8217;t toasted the pecans ,coconut yet, add the pecans to a skillet over medium heat, and toast for 3-4 minutes, and add in the coconut and continue to toast for another 2-3 minutes.<br />
Mix this pecan coconut mixture into the blended date mixture.</p>
<p><img decoding="async" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/?tp_image_id=34867" data-pin-title="Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake" class="alignnone wp-image-34867" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201200%20800'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="pecan coconut caramel swirl needed for vegan German Chocolate Cake recipe " width="1200" height="800" data-pin-description="This Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake is a rich and moist chocolate cake baked in a loaf pan, with the traditional nutty pecan and coconut caramel filling running through the middle!" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/" data-jpibfi-post-title="German Chocolate Loaf Cake" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4931-e1617742352592.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4931-e1617742352592.jpg 1800w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4931-e1617742352592-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4931-e1617742352592-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4931-e1617742352592-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4931-e1617742352592-768x512.jpg 768w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" data-lazy-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4931-e1617742352592.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/?tp_image_id=34867" data-pin-title="Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake" class="alignnone wp-image-34867" src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4931-e1617742352592.jpg" alt="pecan coconut caramel swirl needed for vegan German Chocolate Cake recipe " width="1200" height="800" data-pin-description="This Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake is a rich and moist chocolate cake baked in a loaf pan, with the traditional nutty pecan and coconut caramel filling running through the middle!" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/" data-jpibfi-post-title="German Chocolate Loaf Cake" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4931-e1617742352592.jpg" srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4931-e1617742352592.jpg 1800w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4931-e1617742352592-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4931-e1617742352592-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4931-e1617742352592-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4931-e1617742352592-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></noscript></p>
<p>Add in the salt. Mix well. This is your frosting that you will add to the cake.</p>
<p><img decoding="async" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/?tp_image_id=34863" data-pin-title="Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake" class="alignnone wp-image-34863" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201200%20800'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="dry ingredients needed for German chocolate loaf cake recipe in a white bowl " width="1200" height="800" data-pin-description="This Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake is a rich and moist chocolate cake baked in a loaf pan, with the traditional nutty pecan and coconut caramel filling running through the middle!" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/" data-jpibfi-post-title="German Chocolate Loaf Cake" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4922-e1617742235483.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4922-e1617742235483.jpg 1800w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4922-e1617742235483-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4922-e1617742235483-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4922-e1617742235483-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4922-e1617742235483-768x512.jpg 768w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" data-lazy-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4922-e1617742235483.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/?tp_image_id=34863" data-pin-title="Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake" class="alignnone wp-image-34863" src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4922-e1617742235483.jpg" alt="dry ingredients needed for German chocolate loaf cake recipe in a white bowl " width="1200" height="800" data-pin-description="This Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake is a rich and moist chocolate cake baked in a loaf pan, with the traditional nutty pecan and coconut caramel filling running through the middle!" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/" data-jpibfi-post-title="German Chocolate Loaf Cake" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4922-e1617742235483.jpg" srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4922-e1617742235483.jpg 1800w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4922-e1617742235483-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4922-e1617742235483-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4922-e1617742235483-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4922-e1617742235483-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></noscript></p>
<p>Mix all the dry ingredients for the cake in a bowl, until well combined.</p>
<p><img decoding="async" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/?tp_image_id=34864" data-pin-title="Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake" class="alignnone wp-image-34864" title="German Chocolate Cake" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201200%20800'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="vegan german chocolate cake batter in a white bowl" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-description="This Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake is a rich and moist chocolate cake baked in a loaf pan, with the traditional nutty pecan and coconut caramel filling running through the middle!" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/" data-jpibfi-post-title="German Chocolate Loaf Cake" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4925-e1617742250984.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4925-e1617742250984.jpg 1800w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4925-e1617742250984-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4925-e1617742250984-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4925-e1617742250984-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4925-e1617742250984-768x512.jpg 768w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" data-lazy-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4925-e1617742250984.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/?tp_image_id=34864" data-pin-title="Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake" class="alignnone wp-image-34864" title="German Chocolate Cake" src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4925-e1617742250984.jpg" alt="vegan german chocolate cake batter in a white bowl" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-description="This Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake is a rich and moist chocolate cake baked in a loaf pan, with the traditional nutty pecan and coconut caramel filling running through the middle!" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/" data-jpibfi-post-title="German Chocolate Loaf Cake" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4925-e1617742250984.jpg" srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4925-e1617742250984.jpg 1800w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4925-e1617742250984-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4925-e1617742250984-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4925-e1617742250984-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4925-e1617742250984-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></noscript><br />
Heat the milk until it is hot, then add in all of the rest of the wet ingredients. Add the dry to the wet ingredients, and mix well until you get a somewhat thick batter. If the batter is too thick, add in a tbsp or more of non dairy milk.</p>
<p><img decoding="async" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/?tp_image_id=34868" data-pin-title="Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake" class="alignnone wp-image-34868" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201200%20800'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="coconut caramel layer being spread on top of cake layer to make german chocolate loaf" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-description="This Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake is a rich and moist chocolate cake baked in a loaf pan, with the traditional nutty pecan and coconut caramel filling running through the middle!" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/" data-jpibfi-post-title="German Chocolate Loaf Cake" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4932-e1617742366897.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4932-e1617742366897.jpg 1800w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4932-e1617742366897-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4932-e1617742366897-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4932-e1617742366897-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4932-e1617742366897-768x512.jpg 768w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" data-lazy-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4932-e1617742366897.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/?tp_image_id=34868" data-pin-title="Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake" class="alignnone wp-image-34868" src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4932-e1617742366897.jpg" alt="coconut caramel layer being spread on top of cake layer to make german chocolate loaf" width="1200" height="800" data-pin-description="This Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake is a rich and moist chocolate cake baked in a loaf pan, with the traditional nutty pecan and coconut caramel filling running through the middle!" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/" data-jpibfi-post-title="German Chocolate Loaf Cake" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4932-e1617742366897.jpg" srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4932-e1617742366897.jpg 1800w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4932-e1617742366897-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4932-e1617742366897-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4932-e1617742366897-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4932-e1617742366897-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></noscript></p>
<p>Add half of the batter to a lined 9&#215;5 inch loaf pan, even it out, then top it with half of the frosting mixture. Add in the rest of the batter, then top it with the rest of the frosting mixture.</p>
<p><img decoding="async" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/?tp_image_id=34869" data-pin-title="Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake" class="alignnone wp-image-34869" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201200%20800'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="overhead shot of freshly baked German Chocolate Loaf Cake " width="1200" height="800" data-pin-description="This Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake is a rich and moist chocolate cake baked in a loaf pan, with the traditional nutty pecan and coconut caramel filling running through the middle!" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/" data-jpibfi-post-title="German Chocolate Loaf Cake" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4938-e1617742379594.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4938-e1617742379594.jpg 1800w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4938-e1617742379594-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4938-e1617742379594-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4938-e1617742379594-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4938-e1617742379594-768x512.jpg 768w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" data-lazy-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4938-e1617742379594.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/?tp_image_id=34869" data-pin-title="Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake" class="alignnone wp-image-34869" src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4938-e1617742379594.jpg" alt="overhead shot of freshly baked German Chocolate Loaf Cake " width="1200" height="800" data-pin-description="This Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake is a rich and moist chocolate cake baked in a loaf pan, with the traditional nutty pecan and coconut caramel filling running through the middle!" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/" data-jpibfi-post-title="German Chocolate Loaf Cake" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4938-e1617742379594.jpg" srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4938-e1617742379594.jpg 1800w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4938-e1617742379594-400x267.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4938-e1617742379594-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4938-e1617742379594-680x453.jpg 680w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4938-e1617742379594-768x512.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></noscript></p>
<p>Bake at 375 degrees F for 55 minutes. Cover the pan after the first 35 minutes so that the frosting doesn&#8217;t get too crusty or burnt.<br />
Check the toothpick from the center of the loaf to see if it&#8217;s done.</p>
<p><img decoding="async" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/?tp_image_id=34859" data-pin-title="Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake" class="alignnone wp-image-34859 size-full" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%201200%201800'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="vegan German Chocolate loaf cake being drizzled with melted dark chocolate" width="1200" height="1800" data-pin-description="This Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake is a rich and moist chocolate cake baked in a loaf pan, with the traditional nutty pecan and coconut caramel filling running through the middle!" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/" data-jpibfi-post-title="German Chocolate Loaf Cake" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4965.jpg" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4965.jpg 1200w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4965-400x600.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4965-683x1024.jpg 683w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4965-302x453.jpg 302w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4965-768x1152.jpg 768w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4965-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4965-450x676.jpg 450w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" data-lazy-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4965.jpg" /><noscript><img decoding="async" data-pin-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/?tp_image_id=34859" data-pin-title="Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake" class="alignnone wp-image-34859 size-full" src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4965.jpg" alt="vegan German Chocolate loaf cake being drizzled with melted dark chocolate" width="1200" height="1800" data-pin-description="This Vegan German Chocolate Loaf Cake is a rich and moist chocolate cake baked in a loaf pan, with the traditional nutty pecan and coconut caramel filling running through the middle!" data-jpibfi-post-excerpt="" data-jpibfi-post-url="https://www.veganricha.com/german-chocolate-loaf-cake/" data-jpibfi-post-title="German Chocolate Loaf Cake" data-jpibfi-src="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4965.jpg" srcset="https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4965.jpg 1200w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4965-400x600.jpg 400w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4965-683x1024.jpg 683w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4965-302x453.jpg 302w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4965-768x1152.jpg 768w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4965-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, https://www.veganricha.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/German-Chocolate-Cake-4965-450x676.jpg 450w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></noscript></p>
<p>Once the cake has been sitting in the pan for 15 minutes, take it out of the pan. You can additionally add a drizzle of melted chocolate.</p>
<h2>How to store this loaf cake?</h2>
<p>Store on the counter for up to a day, and in the fridge for up to 7 days.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
