<div class="wp-block-group block-about__content is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow">
<p class="has-text-align-center is-style-heading wp-block-paragraph">Hi, I'm Richa!</p>



<p class="has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph">I create flavorful plant based recipes that are inspired by my Indian upbringing, including many gluten-free, soy-free, and oil-free options.</p>



